text = "Welcome to the maze.... you must escape through the seven, ever growing layers of this spooky maze! But beware, for something is playing games with you - every few seconds, the path in this maze will move around. Even worse, you can only see some of the maze!

In the bottom left, you can see how far you are from the end of the maze.

In the bottom right, you can see how long until the next shift of the path."
